---
      <!-- ============ PROCESS: particles change shape ============ -->
      <section class="process sec sec--dark" id="process" data-rail="Process">
        <div class="process__pin">
          <canvas class="process__cv" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
          <div class="process__ui">
            <p class="eyebrow">Process</p>
            <div class="process__num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="odo odo--big" data-odo="01"></span></div>
            <div class="process__steps">
              <article class="pstep"><span class="pstep__n">Phase 01 · Understand</span><h3>Discover</h3><p>Start with the problem, the available data and the people who need the system.</p></article>
              <article class="pstep"><span class="pstep__n">Phase 02 · Structure</span><h3>Define</h3><p>Map the data flow, API boundaries and database structure before connecting the pieces.</p></article>
              <article class="pstep"><span class="pstep__n">Phase 03 · Implement</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Connect the interface, backend and data layer. Add AI or computer vision where the problem calls for it.</p></article>
              <article class="pstep"><span class="pstep__n">Phase 04 · Evaluate</span><h3>Validate</h3><p>Check system behavior, data quality and model outputs against the original problem.</p></article>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process__hud" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>Phase <b class="ph-n">01</b> / 04</span>
            <span>Points <b class="ph-p">0</b></span>
            <span>State <b class="ph-s">Scatter</b></span>
          </div>
          <ol class="process__ticks" aria-hidden="true"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol>
        </div>
      </section>
